-- הסכם קיבוצי — חישוב המשכורת הקובעת לגמלה בפנסיה התקציבית של עובדי
-- ההוראה במסגרת הרפורמה (31.8.2008): the pension arrangement for teaching
-- employees who moved to Ofek Hadash with a budgetary pension. Who it
-- covers; when it begins, when it enters into force (a government decision
-- under §108 of the pension law) and how long it lasts; chapter B of the
-- pension law applies to them save the determining salary for a full
-- position, which §5 computes as a weighted mean of X, the pre-reform
-- salary carried forward by half the growth of the tabular salary, over
-- the years before the move, and Y, the pension law's own determining
-- salary, over the years after it, with X raised by 70% of the role
-- allowances held at retirement; exhaustion of claims; industrial peace;
-- the union's rights over future legislation; annex א, the institutions;
-- and the wages commissioner's two side letters of 30.8.2008 — a talk
-- within 21 days on an implication the agreement does not settle, and a
-- floor for a disability or death pension in the first year in the reform.
--
-- The pension law (חוק שירות המדינה (גמלאות) [נוסח משולב], התש"ל-1970) is
-- not encoded: what it decides (the determining salary under its §8, the
-- years it counts, the fixed supplements it recognises) is a named input
-- here. The base agreement of 25.12.2008 is imported where it speaks to
-- the same thing: its §150 applies this agreement to every teaching
-- employee who moved to the reform, and its §5 sets the last date for
-- completing the reform that the second side letter counts from.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `base-agreement-5`
IMPORT `base-agreement-150`

§ `הסדר הפנסיה התקציבית של אופק חדש — 31.8.2008`

-- akn:preamble The agreement's frame: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:preamble/p1 The registration stamp under the Collective Agreements Law (16.11.2008, no. 246/2008); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p2 The document's title; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p3 The date of signing; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p4 The first party, the State, and who represents it; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p5 The first party's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p6 "On the one side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p7 The second party, the teachers' union, and who represents it; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p8 The second party's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p9 "On the other side"; no rule.

§§ `המבוא ונספח א' — עובדי ההוראה`

@desc The kinds of institution a teaching employee may be employed in, as far as annex א asks.
DECLARE `institution` IS ONE OF
    `a primary school`
    `a junior high school`
    `a special-education school`
    `a MATYA`
    `a treatment centre`
    `a kindergarten`
    `another institution`

-- Annex א: the institutions the reform is applied in, as the first recital
-- points to them.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1/p1 akn:att_1__hc_1/p2 akn:att_1__hc_1/p3 akn:att_1__hc_1/p4 akn:att_1__hc_1/p5
`the institutions of annex א` MEANS
    LIST `a primary school`, `a junior high school`, `a special-education school`, `a MATYA`, `a treatment centre`

-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p6 The initials at the foot of the annex's page; no rule.

@desc A teaching employee, as far as this agreement asks who it covers.
DECLARE `employee` HAS
    `ranked on the teaching employees' scale`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `employed in the civil service`                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `employed in`                                    IS AN `institution`
    `in the civil service for some period under the agreements before the reform` IS A BOOLEAN
    `moved to employment on reform terms`            IS A BOOLEAN @desc under the collective agreement of 10.9.2007 or another collective agreement (§2)
    `under the budgetary pension of the pension law` IS A BOOLEAN
    `retired from the civil service under the pension law` IS A BOOLEAN

-- The first recital: the reform applies to the employees on the teaching
-- scale employed in the civil service "as annex א details" — "עובדי ההוראה",
-- the term §§4–5 use ("כהגדרתם בהסכם זה").
@ref akn:preamble/p10
GIVEN e IS AN `employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a teaching employee as the recital defines one` e IF
        e's `ranked on the teaching employees' scale`
    AND e's `employed in the civil service`
    AND elem (e's `employed in`) `the institutions of annex א`

-- akn:preamble/p11 A recital: the reform raises the pay of teachers who move to it, the budgetary-pension members among them; it defines "פנסיה תקציבית".
-- akn:preamble/p13 A recital: the parties agreed to the reform because its pay and pension terms are better for those who move.

-- The third recital names the agreement's idea: two determining salaries,
-- one for the service before the move to the reform and one from it (§5's
-- periods A and B).
@ref akn:preamble/p12
DECLARE `period of service` IS ONE OF
    `the service before the move to the reform`
    `the service from the move to the reform`

-- akn:preamble/p16 The words of agreement that introduce the clauses; no rule.

§§ `1 המבוא`

@ref akn:art_1 akn:art_1/p1
DECLARE `part of the agreement` IS ONE OF
    `the preamble`
    `the body of the agreement`
    `an annex`

GIVEN p IS A `part of the agreement`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `binds as the agreement` p IF
    TRUE

#ASSERT `binds as the agreement` `the preamble`

§§ `2 תחולת ההסכם`

-- §2: every teaching employee in the civil service who was in it for some
-- period under the pre-reform agreements, moved to the reform, is under the
-- budgetary pension of the pension law, and retired under it.
--
-- F-ofek-hadash-pension-2008-a: §2 names no institution, while the recital
-- defines "עובדי ההוראה" by annex א, which lists no kindergarten; the
-- reading adopted (convention reading.consistent): §2 sets who is covered,
-- and §§4–5 apply to everyone it covers — as the base agreement's §150 does,
-- applying this agreement to every teaching employee who moved to the reform.
@ref akn:art_2 akn:art_2/p1
GIVEN e IS AN `employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `covered by the agreement` e IF
        e's `ranked on the teaching employees' scale`
    AND e's `employed in the civil service`
    AND e's `in the civil service for some period under the agreements before the reform`
    AND e's `moved to employment on reform terms`
    AND e's `under the budgetary pension of the pension law`
    AND e's `retired from the civil service under the pension law`

`a kindergarten teacher who moved to the reform` MEANS
    `employee` WITH
        `ranked on the teaching employees' scale`        IS TRUE
        `employed in the civil service`                  IS TRUE
        `employed in`                                    IS `a kindergarten`
        `in the civil service for some period under the agreements before the reform` IS TRUE
        `moved to employment on reform terms`            IS TRUE
        `under the budgetary pension of the pension law` IS TRUE
        `retired from the civil service under the pension law` IS TRUE

-- F-ofek-hadash-pension-2008-a's evidence: §2 covers her, the recital's
-- definition does not, and the base agreement's §150 applies this
-- agreement to her as to any teaching employee who moved to the reform.
`§2 covers a kindergarten teacher the recital's definition leaves out` MEANS
        `covered by the agreement` `a kindergarten teacher who moved to the reform`
    AND NOT `a teaching employee as the recital defines one` `a kindergarten teacher who moved to the reform`
    AND `what governs the determining salary in the budgetary pension` TRUE EQUALS JUST `the pension agreement of 31.8.08`
#ASSERT `§2 covers a kindergarten teacher the recital's definition leaves out`

§§ `3 תחילת ההסכם ותוקף ההסכם`

-- (א): the agreement begins on 1.9.07.
@ref akn:art_3 akn:art_3__para_a
`the agreement begins on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2007

-- (ב), with the last two recitals: it enters into force on the day the
-- government decides, under §108 of the pension law, that chapter B of the
-- law no longer applies to teaching employees who moved to the reform and
-- retire on a budgetary pension in תשס"ח or after; until such a decision
-- it is not in force.
@ref akn:art_3__para_b akn:preamble/p14 akn:preamble/p15
GIVEN `the day of the government's decision under section 108` IS A MAYBE DATE, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in force on` `the day of the government's decision under section 108` d IF
    CONSIDER `the day of the government's decision under section 108`
    WHEN JUST decided THEN d `is on or after` decided
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE

#ASSERT NOT `in force on` NOTHING (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2009)
#ASSERT `in force on` (JUST (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2009)) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2009)

-- (ג): its fixed term runs from its beginning until the entitlement of the
-- last teaching employee or survivor under the pension law ends.
@ref akn:art_3__para_c
GIVEN `the day the last entitlement under the pension law ends` IS A MAYBE DATE, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in the agreement's term` `the day the last entitlement under the pension law ends` d IF
        d `is on or after` `the agreement begins on`
    AND CONSIDER `the day the last entitlement under the pension law ends`
        WHEN JUST last THEN d `is on or before` last
        WHEN NOTHING THEN TRUE

#ASSERT `in the agreement's term` NOTHING (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2060)
#ASSERT NOT `in the agreement's term` NOTHING (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2007)

-- (ד): nothing in it grounds a claim that the rest of the pension law does
-- not apply to the teaching employees.
@ref akn:art_3__para_d
`this agreement grounds a claim that the rest of the pension law does not apply` MEANS FALSE

§§ `4 תחולת הוראות פרק ב' לחוק הגמלאות`

DECLARE `pension-law matter` IS ONE OF
    `the determining salary for a full position (sections 8 and 12(a)(1) of the pension law)`
    `the updating of the determining salary after retirement`
    `another provision of chapter B`

DECLARE `what governs` IS ONE OF
    `chapter B of the pension law, as it is from time to time`
    `section 5 of this agreement`

-- ¶1: chapter B of the pension law applies to the teaching employees as it
-- is and as it changes, with the regulations made under it, the courts'
-- reading of it and its application; save the determining salary for a
-- full position under §8 and §12(א)(1), which §5 changes. ¶2: the updating
-- of the determining salary after retirement is chapter B's, as it is from
-- time to time.
@ref akn:art_4 akn:art_4/p1 akn:art_4/p2
GIVEN m IS A `pension-law matter`
GIVETH A `what governs`
DECIDE `what governs the matter for a teaching employee` m IS
    IF m EQUALS `the determining salary for a full position (sections 8 and 12(a)(1) of the pension law)`
    THEN `section 5 of this agreement`
    ELSE `chapter B of the pension law, as it is from time to time`

#ASSERT `what governs the matter for a teaching employee` `the updating of the determining salary after retirement` EQUALS `chapter B of the pension law, as it is from time to time`

-- ¶3: a future amendment of chapter B that changes how the determining
-- salary is computed or set applies to the teaching employees in the way it
-- is applied to the civil servants the law covers.
@ref akn:art_4/p3
GIVEN `how the amendment applies to the civil servants the law covers` IS A STRING
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `how a future amendment of the determining salary applies to the teaching employees` `how the amendment applies to the civil servants the law covers` IS
    `how the amendment applies to the civil servants the law covers`

§§ `5 המשכורת הקובעת`

-- akn:art_5 The section's label; its opening paragraph follows.

@desc A retiring teaching employee, as far as §5 asks. Amounts are monthly, in shekels, for a full position (100%).
DECLARE `retiree` HAS
    `years of service before the move`     IS A NUMBER @desc A: service the pension law counts, up to the move to the reform, without the increases of service the law allows
    `years of service from the move`       IS A NUMBER @desc B: the same, from the move
    `the determining salary under section 8 on the eve of the move, as updated` IS A NUMBER @desc for a full position, updated by every pay change for which the agreement on the move to the reform re-converts
    `class-educator allowance in it`        IS A NUMBER @desc גמול חינוך, in shekels
    `first-grade educator allowance in it`  IS A NUMBER
    `special-education allowance in it`     IS A NUMBER
    `guidance allowance in it`              IS A NUMBER @desc including the dragged guidance allowance
    `counselling allowance in it`           IS A NUMBER @desc including the dragged counselling allowance
    `doctorate allowance in it`             IS A NUMBER
    `the tabular salary after the conversion` IS A NUMBER @desc P: by grade and seniority for a teacher, by grade and complexity level for a first deputy or principal
    `retired as`                           IS A `role at retirement`
    `the tabular salary of T¹`             IS A NUMBER @desc a teacher: in the table he is placed in at retirement, at his seniority at retirement and the grade he was placed in at the conversion; a first deputy or principal: in his table at retirement, at the grade he was first placed in in it and his complexity level at retirement
    `the fixed supplements recognised in the determining salary and not listed in (ה)` IS A NUMBER @desc "תוספות קבועות" as the pension law means them
    `the complexity-level supplement outside the tabular salary` IS A NUMBER @desc a first deputy's or principal's; 0 for a teacher
    `the tabular salary at retirement`      IS A NUMBER @desc Tⁿ
    `the determining salary under section 8 at retirement` IS A NUMBER @desc Y: the pension law's own, as it is from time to time
    `allowances held at retirement`         IS A LIST OF `allowance held at retirement`
    `entitled on the eve of retirement that Y include one of the allowances of (ה)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `had a guidance or counselling allowance in the determining salary on the eve of the move` IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `role at retirement` IS ONE OF
    `a teacher`
    `a first deputy principal`
    `a principal`

DECLARE `allowance of (ה)` IS ONE OF
    `class educator`
    `first-grade class educator`
    `special education`
    `guidance`
    `counselling`
    `doctorate`

@desc One of (ה)'s allowances as it stands at retirement.
DECLARE `allowance held at retirement` HAS
    `allowance`  IS AN `allowance of (ה)`
    `rate`       IS A NUMBER @desc the allowance's rate at retirement, as a share of the salary (10% is 0.1); not used for guidance
    `share of the position in that work` IS A NUMBER @desc for special education or guidance: the share of the position in it on the eve of retirement

-- akn:art_5/p1 The opening: the determining salary of the teaching employees for a full position is computed as (א)–(ו) set out; the rule is `the determining salary for a full position` below.

-- (א) A, B and C. ¶4: "תקופת שירות" is service the pension law counts,
-- without the increases of service the law allows (which the law may still
-- add); the years are the inputs, counted that way.
@ref akn:art_5__para_a akn:art_5__para_a/p2 akn:art_5__para_a/p3 akn:art_5__para_a/p4
GIVEN r IS A `retiree`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `C` r IS
    r's `years of service before the move` PLUS r's `years of service from the move`

-- (א) S: the determining salary under §8 on the eve of the move, updated,
-- without the class-educator, first-grade, special-education, guidance and
-- counselling allowances and half the doctorate allowance.
@ref akn:art_5__para_a/p5
GIVEN r IS A `retiree`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `S` r IS
    r's `the determining salary under section 8 on the eve of the move, as updated`
    MINUS (    r's `class-educator allowance in it`
          PLUS r's `first-grade educator allowance in it`
          PLUS r's `special-education allowance in it`
          PLUS r's `guidance allowance in it`
          PLUS r's `counselling allowance in it`
          PLUS r's `doctorate allowance in it` DIVIDED BY 2)

-- (א) P and R: R is S divided by P (a share; "באחוזים").
@ref akn:art_5__para_a/p6 akn:art_5__para_a/p7
GIVEN r IS A `retiree`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `R` r IS
    `S` r DIVIDED BY r's `the tabular salary after the conversion`

-- (א) T¹: for one who retired as a teacher, the tabular salary of T¹ and
-- the fixed supplements the pension law recognises and (ה) does not list;
-- for a first deputy or principal, the tabular salary of T¹, taken with
-- the complexity-level supplement paid outside it.
--
-- F-ofek-hadash-pension-2008-b: the first deputy's and principal's T¹ names
-- no fixed supplements, though the K paragraph strips them from T¹ "כאמור
-- לעיל" as from every T¹; the reading adopted (convention
-- reading.as-printed): a first deputy's or principal's T¹ carries none.
@ref akn:art_5__para_a/p8 akn:art_5__para_a/p9 akn:art_5__para_a/p10
GIVEN r IS A `retiree`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `T¹` r IS
    IF r's `retired as` EQUALS `a teacher`
    THEN r's `the tabular salary of T¹` PLUS r's `the fixed supplements recognised in the determining salary and not listed in (ה)`
    ELSE r's `the tabular salary of T¹` PLUS r's `the complexity-level supplement outside the tabular salary`

-- (א) Tⁿ and K: K is Tⁿ divided by T¹, where for K T¹ carries neither the
-- fixed supplements nor the complexity-level supplement outside the table.
@ref akn:art_5__para_a/p11 akn:art_5__para_a/p12 akn:art_5__para_a/p13
GIVEN r IS A `retiree`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `K` r IS
    r's `the tabular salary at retirement` DIVIDED BY r's `the tabular salary of T¹`

-- (ב) X, the determining salary for period A: R · T¹ · [50% · (K − 1) + 1].
-- No rounding: the text names none (convention rounding.default).
@ref akn:art_5__para_b akn:art_5__para_b/p2 akn:art_5__para_b/p3
GIVEN r IS A `retiree`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `X` r IS
    `R` r TIMES `T¹` r TIMES (50% TIMES (`K` r MINUS 1) PLUS 1)

-- (ג) Y: the pension law's determining salary at retirement, under its §8
-- as it is from time to time — an input.
@ref akn:art_5__para_c
GIVEN r IS A `retiree`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `Y` r IS
    r's `the determining salary under section 8 at retirement`

-- (ד) Z = X·A/C + Y·B/C: the corpus writes each stacked fraction as its
-- numerators, then the two denominators "C C" on the line below.
@ref akn:art_5__para_d akn:art_5__para_d/p2 akn:art_5__para_d/p3
GIVEN r IS A `retiree`, `the salary for period A` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the weighted determining salary` r `the salary for period A` IS
        `the salary for period A` TIMES r's `years of service before the move` DIVIDED BY `C` r
    PLUS `Y` r TIMES r's `years of service from the move` DIVIDED BY `C` r

-- (ה): where, on the eve of retirement, the teaching employee was entitled
-- to have Y include a class-educator, first-grade educator,
-- special-education, guidance or counselling allowance or the doctorate
-- supplement; or where his determining salary under the pension law held a
-- guidance or counselling allowance on the eve of the move, X becomes X'.
@ref akn:art_5__para_e akn:art_5__para_e/p2 akn:art_5__para_e/p3 akn:art_5__para_e/p4
GIVEN r IS A `retiree`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `(ה) applies to` r IF
    r's `entitled on the eve of retirement that Y include one of the allowances of (ה)`
    OR r's `had a guidance or counselling allowance in the determining salary on the eve of the move`

-- (ה) H, allowance by allowance: the class-educator, first-grade educator,
-- counselling and doctorate rates at retirement; the special-education rate
-- times the share of the position in special education on the eve of
-- retirement; for guidance, 43% times the share of the position in
-- guidance on the eve of retirement.
@ref akn:art_5__para_e/p5 akn:art_5__para_e/p6 akn:art_5__para_e/p7
GIVEN a IS AN `allowance held at retirement`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `H of the allowance` a IS
    CONSIDER a's `allowance`
    WHEN `special education` THEN a's `rate` TIMES a's `share of the position in that work`
    WHEN `guidance`          THEN 43% TIMES a's `share of the position in that work`
    OTHERWISE a's `rate`

-- (ה) X' = X · (1 + 70% · H). H is defined allowance by allowance;
-- F-ofek-hadash-pension-2008-c: for one who holds two of them the text
-- gives two H's and one formula. The reading adopted (convention
-- amounts.per-component): H is the sum of the H of every allowance held.
@ref akn:art_5__para_e/p8 akn:art_5__para_e/p9
GIVEN r IS A `retiree`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `H` r IS
    sum (map `H of the allowance` (r's `allowances held at retirement`))

GIVEN r IS A `retiree`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `X'` r IS
    `X` r TIMES (1 PLUS 70% TIMES `H` r)

-- (ו): for a teaching employee of (ה), Z = X'·A/C + Y·B/C (the same two
-- stacked fractions as (ד)).
@ref akn:art_5__para_f akn:art_5__para_f/p2 akn:art_5__para_f/p3
GIVEN r IS A `retiree`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the determining salary for a full position` r IS
    IF `(ה) applies to` r
    THEN `the weighted determining salary` r (`X'` r)
    ELSE `the weighted determining salary` r (`X` r)

-- Worked examples. A teacher with 20 years before the move and 10 after:
-- S = 8,000, P = 10,000 (R = 80%), T¹ = 11,000 + 500 fixed supplements,
-- Tⁿ = 13,200 (K = 120%): X = 0.8 · 11,500 · 1.1 = 10,120; Y = 14,000;
-- Z = (10,120 · 20 + 14,000 · 10) / 30.
GIVEN `retired as` IS A `role at retirement`
      held IS A LIST OF `allowance held at retirement`
      `entitled that Y include` IS A BOOLEAN
      `guidance at the move` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `retiree`
DECIDE `a retiree of the example` `retired as` held `entitled that Y include` `guidance at the move` IS
    `retiree` WITH
        `years of service before the move`     IS 20
        `years of service from the move`       IS 10
        `the determining salary under section 8 on the eve of the move, as updated` IS 8000
        `class-educator allowance in it`        IS 0
        `first-grade educator allowance in it`  IS 0
        `special-education allowance in it`     IS 0
        `guidance allowance in it`              IS 0
        `counselling allowance in it`           IS 0
        `doctorate allowance in it`             IS 0
        `the tabular salary after the conversion` IS 10000
        `retired as`                           IS `retired as`
        `the tabular salary of T¹`             IS 11000
        `the fixed supplements recognised in the determining salary and not listed in (ה)` IS 500
        `the complexity-level supplement outside the tabular salary` IS 0
        `the tabular salary at retirement`      IS 13200
        `the determining salary under section 8 at retirement` IS 14000
        `allowances held at retirement`         IS held
        `entitled on the eve of retirement that Y include one of the allowances of (ה)` IS `entitled that Y include`
        `had a guidance or counselling allowance in the determining salary on the eve of the move` IS `guidance at the move`

`the example teacher` MEANS `a retiree of the example` `a teacher` EMPTY FALSE FALSE

#ASSERT `R` `the example teacher` EQUALS 0.8
#ASSERT `K` `the example teacher` EQUALS 1.2
#ASSERT `X` `the example teacher` EQUALS 10120
#ASSERT `the determining salary for a full position` `the example teacher` EQUALS (10120 TIMES 20 PLUS 14000 TIMES 10) DIVIDED BY 30

-- The same teacher as a class educator at 10% at retirement: X' = X · 1.07.
`a class educator at 10%` MEANS
    `allowance held at retirement` WITH
        `allowance` IS `class educator`
        `rate`      IS 10%
        `share of the position in that work` IS 1
`the example class educator` MEANS `a retiree of the example` `a teacher` (LIST `a class educator at 10%`) TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `X'` `the example class educator` EQUALS 10120 TIMES 1.07

-- A guide in half a position in guidance: H = 43% · 0.5.
`a guide in half a position` MEANS
    `allowance held at retirement` WITH
        `allowance` IS `guidance`
        `rate`      IS 0
        `share of the position in that work` IS 0.5
#ASSERT `H of the allowance` `a guide in half a position` EQUALS 0.215

-- F-ofek-hadash-pension-2008-b's evidence: the same figures for a
-- principal give a T¹ without the 500 of fixed supplements.
`the example principal` MEANS `a retiree of the example` `a principal` EMPTY FALSE FALSE
`a principal's T¹ carries no fixed supplements where a teacher's does` MEANS
        `T¹` `the example teacher` EQUALS 11500
    AND `T¹` `the example principal` EQUALS 11000
#ASSERT `a principal's T¹ carries no fixed supplements where a teacher's does`

-- F-ofek-hadash-pension-2008-c's evidence: a class educator at 10% who also
-- holds a doctorate supplement at 5% has two H's, and (ה) one formula.
`a doctorate supplement at 5%` MEANS
    `allowance held at retirement` WITH
        `allowance` IS `doctorate`
        `rate`      IS 5%
        `share of the position in that work` IS 1
`a class educator with a doctorate` MEANS
    `a retiree of the example` `a teacher` (LIST `a class educator at 10%`, `a doctorate supplement at 5%`) TRUE FALSE
`a class educator with a doctorate has two H's for one formula` MEANS
    map `H of the allowance` (`a class educator with a doctorate`'s `allowances held at retirement`) EQUALS LIST 10%, 5%
#ASSERT `a class educator with a doctorate has two H's for one formula`
#ASSERT `H` `a class educator with a doctorate` EQUALS 15%

§§ `6 מיצוי תביעות`

-- The agreement exhausts the parties' claims on what it settles; no
-- further negotiation on those matters.
DECLARE `section 6 action` IS ONE OF `negotiate further on a matter this agreement settles`

@ref akn:art_6 akn:art_6/p1
`no further negotiation` MEANS
    (PARTY `the State`
     SHANT `negotiate further on a matter this agreement settles`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the teachers' union`
     SHANT `negotiate further on a matter this agreement settles`)

§§ `7 שקט תעשייתי`

DECLARE `section 7 action` IS ONE OF `strike, lock out or otherwise disrupt work over a matter this agreement settles`

-- In the agreement's term neither party, nor a unit of it, takes a strike,
-- a lock-out or other organised disruption against the other over what it
-- settles.
@ref akn:art_7 akn:art_7/p1
`industrial peace` MEANS
    (PARTY `the State`
     SHANT `strike, lock out or otherwise disrupt work over a matter this agreement settles`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the teachers' union`
     SHANT `strike, lock out or otherwise disrupt work over a matter this agreement settles`)

§§ `8`

-- §8: applying a future amendment of the law through this agreement takes
-- nothing from the union's rights as a workers' organisation: they are as
-- if the amendment applied directly.
@ref akn:art_8
GIVEN `the union's rights over an amendment that applies directly` IS A STRING
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `the union's rights over an amendment applied through this agreement` `the union's rights over an amendment that applies directly` IS
    `the union's rights over an amendment that applies directly`

