§§ `מכתב 2008-7497 — השלכות שאינן מוסדרות בהסכם`

DECLARE `letter 7497 action` IS ONE OF `discuss the claimed implication with the other party`

-- A party's claim that the change in computing the determining salary, or
-- applying it, has implications this agreement does not settle, on rights
-- that existed on the day it was signed, is discussed between the parties
-- within 21 days of one party's written request.
@ref akn:att_2__hc_1/p13
GIVEN `the implication is settled in this agreement` IS A BOOLEAN, `it is on a right that existed on the signing` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `letter 7497 action`
DECIDE `the talk on an implication` `the implication is settled in this agreement` `it is on a right that existed on the signing` IS
    IF (NOT `the implication is settled in this agreement`) AND `it is on a right that existed on the signing`
    THEN (PARTY `the State`
          MUST `discuss the claimed implication with the other party`
          WITHIN 21
          LEST BREACH BY `the State` BECAUSE "letter 2008-7497: the talk is held within 21 days of the written request")
         RAND
         (PARTY `the teachers' union`
          MUST `discuss the claimed implication with the other party`
          WITHIN 21
          LEST BREACH BY `the teachers' union` BECAUSE "letter 2008-7497: the talk is held within 21 days of the written request")
    ELSE FULFILLED

