§§ `מכתב 2008-7499 — פנסיית נכות ושאירים`

-- The same day in the next year, the end of a year that runs from d
-- (convention dates.calendar: the calendar as it is).
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `a year after` d IS
    DATE_FROM_DMY (DATE_DAY d) (DATE_MONTH d) (DATE_YEAR d PLUS 1)

-- A teaching employee who retires for disability or dies in the first year
-- after he joined the reform, and no later than the end of a year from the
-- last date for completing the reform, gets a determining salary no lower
-- than the one his pension would have been computed by had he not moved.
-- The end of a year from a day is the day before its anniversary, which is
-- in the year (convention dates.end).
--
-- F-ofek-hadash-pension-2008-d: the letter does not say which instrument
-- sets "the last date for completing the reform". The reading adopted
-- (convention instruments.governing-term): the agreement that governs the
-- reform when the floor is applied — the base agreement of 25.12.2008,
-- whose §5 (imported) sets 1.9.2013.
@ref akn:att_3__hc_1/p13
GIVEN `joined the reform on` IS A DATE, `retired on` IS A DATE, `for disability or death` IS A BOOLEAN, `the last date for completing the reform` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the disability and death floor applies` `joined the reform on` `retired on` `for disability or death` `the last date for completing the reform` IF
        `for disability or death`
    AND `retired on` `is on or after` `joined the reform on`
    AND DATE_SERIAL `retired on` LESS THAN DATE_SERIAL (`a year after` `joined the reform on`)
    AND DATE_SERIAL `retired on` LESS THAN DATE_SERIAL (`a year after` `the last date for completing the reform`)

GIVEN r IS A `retiree`, `joined the reform on` IS A DATE, `retired on` IS A DATE, `for disability or death` IS A BOOLEAN, `the determining salary had he not moved to the reform` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the determining salary with the disability and death floor` r `joined the reform on` `retired on` `for disability or death` `the determining salary had he not moved to the reform` IS
    IF `the disability and death floor applies` `joined the reform on` `retired on` `for disability or death` `the reform is complete by`
    THEN max (`the determining salary for a full position` r) `the determining salary had he not moved to the reform`
    ELSE `the determining salary for a full position` r

#ASSERT `the determining salary with the disability and death floor` `the example teacher` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2008) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2009) TRUE 12000 EQUALS 12000
#ASSERT NOT `the disability and death floor applies` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2008) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2009) TRUE `the reform is complete by`

-- F-ofek-hadash-pension-2008-d's evidence: a teacher who joined on 1.9.2013
-- and retired for disability on 1.6.2014 has the floor with the base
-- agreement's date and not with 1.9.2012, the date the founding agreement
-- of 10.9.2007 (§4, not encoded) set when the letter was written; that
-- date is here only as the evidence, never in a rule.
`the floor turns on which instrument's last date is read` MEANS
        `the disability and death floor applies` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2013) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2014) TRUE `the reform is complete by`
    AND NOT `the disability and death floor applies` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2013) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2014) TRUE (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2012)
#ASSERT `the floor turns on which instrument's last date is read`

